        "EA LM Studio - prompt enhancer\n\nSetup:\n1. Start LM Studio and enable its local server (default 127.0.0.1:1234).\n2. Start ComfyUI AFTER LM Studio so the model list is populated, or flip\n   the refresh_models toggle on the node to fetch it now.\n3. Pick your model in model_selection.\n\nThe response is shown inside the node itself and is also wired to the\nPreview as Text nodes so you can see the thinking and the diagnostics.\n\nTo feed an image generator, wire the 'response' output into a\nCLIP Text Encode node's text input instead of the preview.\n\nunload_llm is ON by default so the LLM frees its VRAM before you\nrender - turn it off to keep the model warm between runs."
